      (Profiles > New Profile > Import). The composite (every tunnel) and the
      .list. groups (one server's, or the warped ones) switch tunnels in the app's
      picker without dropping the VPN; a one-tunnel profile switches by switching
      profiles. They hold private keys: delete the copies you send.
